['C14','Free cash certification timing','Free cash available for FY2025 was certified on 2024-12-09; in the other years FY2016-FY2027 certification fell between early September and mid-October.',V,'DLS-FC','Dartmouth rows, date certified','Late certification delays the availability of free cash for fall Town Meeting. Cause not documented in sources reviewed. The state file shows 2019-09-12 for both FY2019 and FY2020, which may be a data-entry duplicate.'],
